<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1004)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Issue a License…</b> lives at the top of the Review Manager now &#8212; for someone who hasn't asked, the same window, letter and Mail step. The two Review-menu items (the invite file, the license) are gone: a personal link does what the invite file did.</li>
<li>A license opened while the app is running confirms it was taken, with its expiry.</li>
</ul>
