<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1002)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Threaded replies.</b> The arrow on any reply answers that reply, and the thread indents under it (three levels at most); a &#8220;Replying to &#8230;&#8221; line above the field says where your reply lands. Voice and file replies thread too. The web page does the same.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
